        "Performance Features",
        "1. The main shaft is side‑hung on the frame. The bearing body features compact structure, easy installation and good verticality.\n2. The impeller adopts conical cross‑section, and the stator is radial‑arranged. It has low wear, long service life and strong agitation force.\n3. The U‑shaped cell body reduces ore sedimentation at the tank bottom. The main‑shaft assembly is compact; the stator is mounted on the cell bottom for easy installation. Low installed power, achieving 50% energy saving compared with Type‑A flotation machine.\n4. Evenly‑dispersed air bubbles, good air distribution, stable froth, favorable particle suspension performance and high recovery rate.",
